<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Temple of the Lion's Bell</title><style>

:root{
--sand:#c9a96b;
--gold:#e0bf78;
--dark:#070505;
--temple:#140c08;
--flame:#ff7b2f;
--ink:#f3e9d7;
--muted:#cdbf9c;
}

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

body{
font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
background:
radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%,rgba(255,220,140,.15),transparent 30%),
linear-gradient(#030202,#080403 60%,#020202);
color:var(--ink);
overflow-x:hidden;
}

/* star sky */
body::before{
content:"";
position:fixed;
inset:0;
pointer-events:none;
background-image:
radial-gradient(circle at 15% 15%,white 0 1px,transparent 2px),
radial-gradient(circle at 45% 30%,white 0 1px,transparent 2px),
radial-gradient(circle at 70% 20%,white 0 1px,transparent 2px),
radial-gradient(circle at 85% 50%,white 0 1px,transparent 2px);
opacity:.6;
}

/* side flames */
body::after{
content:"";
position:fixed;
inset:0;
pointer-events:none;
background:
radial-gradient(circle at 5% 50%,rgba(255,123,47,.4),transparent 40%),
radial-gradient(circle at 95% 50%,rgba(255,123,47,.4),transparent 40%);
opacity:.8;
}

.page{
width:min(1100px,92%);
margin:auto;
position:relative;
z-index:1;
}

nav{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
padding:1.3rem 0;
border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,210,120,.18);
}

.brand{
text-transform:uppercase;
letter-spacing:.18em;
}

.brand small{
display:block;
font-size:.65rem;
color:var(--muted);
}

.brand strong{
font-size:.9rem;
}

nav a{
text-decoration:none;
color:var(--ink);
margin-left:1.2rem;
font-size:.72rem;
letter-spacing:.15em;
text-transform:uppercase;
}

nav a:hover{color:var(--gold)}

/* HERO */
.hero{
text-align:center;
padding:6rem 0 4rem;
}

.hero-card{
background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(30,18,10,.8),rgba(10,6,4,.6));
border:1px solid rgba(230,190,110,.2);
border-radius:30px;
padding:3rem 2rem;
box-shadow:0 0 80px rgba(255,150,70,.15);
}

.symbols{
letter-spacing:.7rem;
color:var(--gold);
margin-bottom:1rem;
}

h1{
font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5rem);
text-transform:uppercase;
letter-spacing:.08em;
margin-bottom:1rem;
text-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,150,60,.35);
}

.subtitle{
max-width:720px;
margin:auto;
line-height:1.8;
color:var(--muted);
}

.cta{
margin-top:2rem;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
flex-wrap:wrap;
gap:1rem;
}

.btn{
padding:.9rem 1.2rem;
border-radius:999px;
text-decoration:none;
font-size:.75rem;
letter-spacing:.14em;
text-transform:uppercase;
border:1px solid rgba(230,190,110,.35);
color:var(--ink);
}

.btn.primary{
background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(230,190,110,.3),rgba(120,70,20,.2));
}

.btn:hover{color:var(--gold)}

/* sections */
section{margin-top:4rem}

.section-title{
text-align:center;
margin-bottom:2rem;
}

.section-title h2{
text-transform:uppercase;
letter-spacing:.1em;
margin-bottom:.5rem;
}

.section-title p{
max-width:650px;
margin:auto;
color:var(--muted);
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
gap:1rem;
}

.card{
background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(28,16,10,.85),rgba(12,7,5,.8));
border:1px solid rgba(230,190,110,.18);
border-radius:20px;
padding:1.5rem;
position:relative;
}

.card::after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
inset:10px;
border:1px solid rgba(230,190,110,.08);
border-radius:12px;
pointer-events:none;
}

.card h3{
margin:.6rem 0;
font-size:1rem;
text-transform:uppercase;
letter-spacing:.08em;
}

.card p{
color:var(--muted);
line-height:1.7;
font-size:.95rem;
}

.glyph{
font-size:1.6rem;
color:var(--gold);
}

/* temple vow */
.manifesto{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;
gap:1rem;
}

.panel{
background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(25,14,8,.92),rgba(8,5,3,.9));
border:1px solid rgba(230,190,110,.2);
border-radius:24px;
padding:1.6rem;
}

.quote{
font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.3vw,1.9rem);
line-height:1.5;
}

.quote strong{color:var(--gold)}

.ritual{text-align:center}

.ritual .symbol{
font-size:4rem;
margin:1rem 0;
color:var(--gold);
text-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,140,60,.5);
}

footer{
margin-top:4rem;
padding:1.4rem 0;
border-top:1px solid rgba(230,190,110,.18);
text-align:center;
font-size:.7rem;
letter-spacing:.12em;
color:var(--muted);
text-transform:uppercase;
}

@media(max-width:900px){
.grid,.manifesto{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}

</style></head><body><div class="page"><nav>
<div class="brand">
<small>Ancient Temple Archive</small>
<strong>The Order of the Lion's Bell</strong>
</div><div>
<a href="#temple">Temple</a>
<a href="#archive">Archive</a>
<a href="#watch">Skywatch</a>
<a href="#initiate">Initiate</a>
</div>
</nav><section class="hero"><div class="hero-card"><div class="symbols">♌ ✦ 🔔 ✦ ☀ ✦ ⟁ ✦ ✦</div><h1>
Temple of
The Lion's Bell
</h1><p class="subtitle">
Deep beneath the sands lies the hidden temple of the Lion's Bell. Ancient guardians preserved knowledge of the heavens, the pyramids, and the watchers beyond the stars. Through flame and shadow the heralds keep the ancient vigil.
</p><div class="cta">
<a class="btn primary" href="#initiate">Enter the Temple</a>
<a class="btn" href="#archive">View Records</a>
</div></div></section><section id="temple"><div class="section-title">
<h2>The Ancient Temple</h2>
<p>
Hidden chambers beneath the pyramids once held astronomer-priests who studied the movement of stars and the strange lights crossing the night sky.
</p>
</div><div class="grid"><div class="card">
<div class="glyph">♌</div>
<h3>Lion Guardians</h3>
<p>
Stone lions guarded the temple gates. They symbolized the protectors of sacred knowledge.
</p>
</div><div class="card">
<div class="glyph">⟁</div>
<h3>Pyramid Archives</h3>
<p>
Hidden vaults beneath the pyramids preserved celestial maps and ancient philosophy.
</p>
</div><div class="card">
<div class="glyph">🛸</div>
<h3>Celestial Watchers</h3>
<p>
Some believe the ancient priests recorded visitors from the stars who appeared in silent craft.
</p>
</div></div></section><section id="archive"><div class="section-title">
<h2>The Sacred Archive</h2>
<p>
Within the Order's temple are preserved fragments of lost philosophy, star maps, and temple diagrams.
</p>
</div><div class="manifesto"><div class="panel"><p class="quote">
"Between the <strong>lion</strong>, the <strong>sun</strong>, and the <strong>stars</strong> lies a forgotten temple where knowledge waits beneath the sand."
</p></div><div class="panel ritual" id="watch"><h3>The Bell Rite</h3><div class="symbol">🔔</div><p>
At nightfall the heralds remember the sound of the sacred bell that once called the temple watchers.
</p></div></div></section><section id="initiate"><div class="section-title">
<h2>Initiation</h2>
<p>
Those who seek the temple must prove worthy of the Lion and the Bell.
</p>
</div><div class="grid"><div class="card">
<div class="glyph">I</div>
<h3>The Seeker</h3>
<p>Present a mystery worthy of the temple archive.</p>
</div><div class="card">
<div class="glyph">II</div>
<h3>The Oath</h3>
<p>Swear loyalty to the guardianship of ancient knowledge.</p>
</div><div class="card">
<div class="glyph">III</div>
<h3>The Bell</h3>
<p>If accepted the bell will call you into the order.</p>
</div></div></section><footer>
The Order of the Lion's Bell · Temple Beneath the Sands
</footer></div></body>
</html>
